{"Title":"An Act relative to consumer rights of renters","BillNumber":"H4474","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J17","Name":"Joint Committee on Consumer Protection and Professional Licensure","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17","ResponseDate":"2024-01-25T08:42:44.343"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T16:40:50.11"},{"Id":"WCG1","Name":"William C. Galvin","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WCG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T13:23:43.4233333"},{"Id":"PAS1","Name":"Paul A. Schmid III","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PAS1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T17:50:08.8366667"},{"Id":"E_U1","Name":"Erika Uyterhoeven","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/E_U1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T10:36:54.75"},{"Id":"MMD1","Name":"Michelle M. DuBois","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MMD1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-08T13:53:46.8166667"},{"Id":"C_H1","Name":"Christopher Hendricks","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/C_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-01T14:25:03.7066667"},{"Id":"A_S1","Name":"Alan Silvia","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/A_S1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-10T10:39:13.49"},{"Id":"SLG1","Name":"Susannah M. Whipps","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SLG1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-10T10:39:13.49"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4474/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 15B of chapter 186 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2022 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting at the end thereof the following:-\r\n\t(10) A lessor, or agent thereof, of a residential property shall not require the signing of a lease more than three months in advance of the termination date of the current lease.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 87DDD1/2 of chapter 112 of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by adding at the end thereof the following two sentences: - Such licensed broker or salesman may solely contract with a prospective tenant to locate for rent residential or commercial real property for a tenant and present an offer to lease to the landlord or landlord's agent and negotiate on behalf of the tenant, or may solely contract to find a tenant for a property with a landlord or landlord’s agent. Any fee shall only be paid by the party, lessor or tenant who originally engaged and entered into a contract with the licensed broker or salesman.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Redraft","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J17","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}